{"ts": "2026-06-26T11:35:08+0530", "level": "INFO", "logger": "agent_framework", "trace_id": "8d7d280e565544288fb888d0cf961f5f", "span_id": "1bf14e98b98b5d40", "parent_span_id": "-", "request_id": "17051B7D", "msg": "{'role': 'tool', 'parts': [{'type': 'tool_call_response', 'id': 'fc_f1b5859f-1c01-47cb-b586-971233bd901c', 'response': \"Based on the **FAB Corporate Term Loan Product Manual (v2.0, Section 5.1)**, the following documentation is required for a term loan credit approval:\\n\\n1. **Completed Credit Application Form (CAF)** – Specific form: `FAB-CAF-CORP-2024`.\\n2. **Audited Financial Statements** – Minimum of 3 years, with the most recent year being no older than 18 months.\\n3. **Management Accounts** – Required if the most recent audited accounts are older than 12 months.\\n4. **Financing Purpose Documentation** – Supporting evidence such as project plans, acquisition agreements, or capital expenditure (capex) schedules, as applicable.\\n5. **KYC Documentation** – In compliance with FAB's KYC Policy (`FAB-POL-KYC-2024`).\\n6. **GERNAS Pricing Agent Output** – Must include the full recommendation with supporting scenarios, RAROC calculation, and the **MRM Evidence Pack**. \\n   *⚠️ Note:* The GERNAS Pricing Agent MRM Evidence Pack is mandatory for all credit approval submissions effective **June 1, 2024**. Proposals submitted without it will be returned without review.\\n7. **Pricing Exception Documentation** – Required if the pricing falls below statutory floor rates (per `FAB-POL-PRICE-2024-v2.4`, Section 6).\\n\\nPlease ensure all documents are up to date and submitted together to avoid delays in the credit approval process.\"}]}"}
{"ts": "2026-06-26T11:35:10+0530", "level": "INFO", "logger": "agent_framework", "trace_id": "8d7d280e565544288fb888d0cf961f5f", "span_id": "1bf14e98b98b5d40", "parent_span_id": "-", "request_id": "17051B7D", "msg": "{'role': 'assistant', 'parts': [{'type': 'text', 'content': '**Documentation required to apply for a term loan (FAB Corporate Term Loan Product Manual\\u202fv2.0, Section\\u202f5.1):**\\n\\n1. **Completed Credit Application Form (CAF)** – Form\\u202f`FAB-CAF-CORP-2024`.  \\n2. **Audited Financial Statements** – Minimum\\u202f3\\u202fyears; the most recent year must be no older than\\u202f18\\u202fmonths.  \\n3. **Management Accounts** – Required if the latest audited statements are older than\\u202f12\\u202fmonths.  \\n4. **Financing Purpose Documentation** – Project plans, acquisition agreements, or capital‑expenditure (capex) schedules, as applicable to the loan’s purpose.  \\n5. **KYC Documentation** – In accordance with FAB’s KYC Policy (`FAB-POL-KYC-2024`).  \\n6. **GERNAS Pricing Agent Output** – Full recommendation with supporting scenarios, RAROC calculation, and the **MRM Evidence Pack**.  \\n   - ⚠️ The MRM Evidence Pack is mandatory for all credit‑approval submissions effective\\u202f1\\u202fJune\\u202f2024; proposals without it will be returned.  \\n7. **Pricing Exception Documentation** – Needed if the proposed pricing is below statutory floor rates (per `FAB-POL-PRICE-2024‑v2.4`, Section\\u202f6).  \\n\\nEnsure all documents are current and submitted together to avoid delays in the credit‑approval process.'}]}"}
{"ts": "2026-06-26T11:35:10+0530", "level": "INFO", "logger": "agent_framework", "trace_id": "8d7d280e565544288fb888d0cf961f5f", "span_id": "4488eeb909f6e7dc", "parent_span_id": "-", "request_id": "17051B7D", "msg": "{'role': 'assistant', 'parts': [{'type': 'tool_call', 'id': 'fc_f1b5859f-1c01-47cb-b586-971233bd901c', 'name': 'query_knowledge_base', 'arguments': '{\"question\":\"What documentation is required to apply for a term loan?\"}'}]}"}
{"ts": "2026-06-26T11:35:10+0530", "level": "INFO", "logger": "agent_framework", "trace_id": "8d7d280e565544288fb888d0cf961f5f", "span_id": "4488eeb909f6e7dc", "parent_span_id": "-", "request_id": "17051B7D", "msg": "{'role': 'tool', 'parts': [{'type': 'tool_call_response', 'id': 'fc_f1b5859f-1c01-47cb-b586-971233bd901c', 'response': \"Based on the **FAB Corporate Term Loan Product Manual (v2.0, Section 5.1)**, the following documentation is required for a term loan credit approval:\\n\\n1. **Completed Credit Application Form (CAF)** – Specific form: `FAB-CAF-CORP-2024`.\\n2. **Audited Financial Statements** – Minimum of 3 years, with the most recent year being no older than 18 months.\\n3. **Management Accounts** – Required if the most recent audited accounts are older than 12 months.\\n4. **Financing Purpose Documentation** – Supporting evidence such as project plans, acquisition agreements, or capital expenditure (capex) schedules, as applicable.\\n5. **KYC Documentation** – In compliance with FAB's KYC Policy (`FAB-POL-KYC-2024`).\\n6. **GERNAS Pricing Agent Output** – Must include the full recommendation with supporting scenarios, RAROC calculation, and the **MRM Evidence Pack**. \\n   *⚠️ Note:* The GERNAS Pricing Agent MRM Evidence Pack is mandatory for all credit approval submissions effective **June 1, 2024**. Proposals submitted without it will be returned without review.\\n7. **Pricing Exception Documentation** – Required if the pricing falls below statutory floor rates (per `FAB-POL-PRICE-2024-v2.4`, Section 6).\\n\\nPlease ensure all documents are up to date and submitted together to avoid delays in the credit approval process.\"}]}"}
{"ts": "2026-06-26T11:35:10+0530", "level": "INFO", "logger": "agent_framework", "trace_id": "8d7d280e565544288fb888d0cf961f5f", "span_id": "4488eeb909f6e7dc", "parent_span_id": "-", "request_id": "17051B7D", "msg": "{'role': 'assistant', 'parts': [{'type': 'text', 'content': '**Documentation required to apply for a term loan (FAB Corporate Term Loan Product Manual\\u202fv2.0, Section\\u202f5.1):**\\n\\n1. **Completed Credit Application Form (CAF)** – Form\\u202f`FAB-CAF-CORP-2024`.  \\n2. **Audited Financial Statements** – Minimum\\u202f3\\u202fyears; the most recent year must be no older than\\u202f18\\u202fmonths.  \\n3. **Management Accounts** – Required if the latest audited statements are older than\\u202f12\\u202fmonths.  \\n4. **Financing Purpose Documentation** – Project plans, acquisition agreements, or capital‑expenditure (capex) schedules, as applicable to the loan’s purpose.  \\n5. **KYC Documentation** – In accordance with FAB’s KYC Policy (`FAB-POL-KYC-2024`).  \\n6. **GERNAS Pricing Agent Output** – Full recommendation with supporting scenarios, RAROC calculation, and the **MRM Evidence Pack**.  \\n   - ⚠️ The MRM Evidence Pack is mandatory for all credit‑approval submissions effective\\u202f1\\u202fJune\\u202f2024; proposals without it will be returned.  \\n7. **Pricing Exception Documentation** – Needed if the proposed pricing is below statutory floor rates (per `FAB-POL-PRICE-2024‑v2.4`, Section\\u202f6).  \\n\\nEnsure all documents are current and submitted together to avoid delays in the credit‑approval process.'}]}"}
