{"ts": "2026-06-26T11:58:26+0530", "level": "INFO", "logger": "agent_framework", "trace_id": "85c81cc953f8180d43a7e5def0dd3db3", "span_id": "aaa3023fb66f81ed", "parent_span_id": "-", "request_id": "6D027613", "msg": "{'role': 'assistant', 'parts': [{'type': 'tool_call', 'id': 'fc_f97fe62b-4231-41ed-b24c-eccb3abd13e2', 'name': 'query_knowledge_base', 'arguments': '{\"question\":\"When should senior management be involved regarding model risks?\"}'}]}"}
{"ts": "2026-06-26T11:58:26+0530", "level": "INFO", "logger": "agent_framework", "trace_id": "85c81cc953f8180d43a7e5def0dd3db3", "span_id": "aaa3023fb66f81ed", "parent_span_id": "-", "request_id": "6D027613", "msg": "{'role': 'tool', 'parts': [{'type': 'tool_call_response', 'id': 'fc_f97fe62b-4231-41ed-b24c-eccb3abd13e2', 'response': 'Based on the FAB Model Risk Management Framework and the Central Bank of the UAE\\'s (CBUAE) AI Governance Circular, senior management and the Board must be involved in specific governance, oversight, and escalation scenarios regarding model risks.\\n\\nKey triggers and requirements for senior management involvement include:\\n\\n**1. Annual Governance Policy Approval (Board Level)**\\nThe Board of Directors must adopt, maintain, and formally review and re-approve a written AI Governance Policy at least annually. This policy must define the bank\\'s risk appetite for AI-related risks, accountability structures, human oversight requirements, and regulatory reporting obligations.\\n* *Source: [CBUAE_Circular_2024_BSE_047_AI_Governance · Article 2.1.1]*\\n\\n**2. Designation of Senior Oversight (Executive Level)**\\nA designated member of senior management—holding a position no lower than the Chief Risk Officer—must be formally appointed as the \"AI Risk Officer.\" This individual is responsible for overseeing the implementation of governance standards and model risk management protocols.\\n* *Source: [CBUAE_Circular_2024_BSE_047_AI_Governance · Article 2.1.2]*\\n\\n**3. Escalation of Systematic Model Overrides (Performance Monitoring)**\\nSenior management (specifically the AI Risk Officer) must be involved when models are systematically failing or bypassing human use. Any systematic pattern of overrides—defined as override rates exceeding **25% of recommendations over a rolling 90-day period**—must be reported to the AI Risk Officer and reviewed as a critical indicator of potential model performance degradation.\\n* *Source: [CBUAE_Circular_2024_BSE_047_AI_Governance · Article 5.2.2]*\\n\\n**4. Maintenance of Model Evidence Packs**\\nSenior management and governance bodies must ensure that a Model Evidence Pack (MEP) is maintained for all Tier 1 and Tier 2 models. These packs, which include validation records, known failure modes, and performance metrics, must be kept updated following any material model changes and made available to auditors and regulators upon request.\\n* *Source: [FAB_Model_Risk_Management_Framework_v3.1 · Section 3]*'}]}"}
{"ts": "2026-06-26T11:58:27+0530", "level": "INFO", "logger": "agent_framework", "trace_id": "85c81cc953f8180d43a7e5def0dd3db3", "span_id": "aaa3023fb66f81ed", "parent_span_id": "-", "request_id": "6D027613", "msg": "{'role': 'assistant', 'parts': [{'type': 'text', 'content': '**متى يجب إشراك الإدارة العليا فيما يتعلق بمخاطر النماذج**\\n\\n1. **الموافقة السنوية على سياسات الحوكمة**  \\n   - يجب على مجلس الإدارة اعتماد\\u202f/\\u202fمراجعة\\u202f/\\u202fإعادة اعتماد سياسات حوكمة الذكاء الاصطناعي (AI Governance Policy) كتابةً على الأقل مرة كل عام.  \\n   - *المصدر: CBUAE_Circular_2024_BSE_047_AI_Governance – المادة 2.1.1*\\n\\n2. **تعيين مسؤول مخاطر الذكاء الاصطناعي**  \\n   - يجب تعيين عضو من الإدارة العليا (ليس أدنى من رئيس قسم المخاطر – CRO) كـ “مسؤول مخاطر الذكاء الاصطناعي” (AI Risk Officer) لتولي الإشراف على تنفيذ معايير الحوكمة وإدارة مخاطر النماذج.  \\n   - *المصدر: CBUAE_Circular_2024_BSE_047_AI_Governance – المادة 2.1.2*\\n\\n3. **تصعيد حالات تجاوز نظامية للنماذج (Performance Monitoring)**  \\n   - عندما تتجاوز معدلات تجاوز توصيات النموذج\\u202f25\\u202f٪ على مدى فترة متداولة تبلغ 90 يوماً، يجب إبلاغ مسؤول مخاطر الذكاء الاصطناعي وإجراء مراجعة إدارية لتقييم تدهور أداء النموذج.  \\n   - *المصدر: CBUAE_Circular_2024_BSE_047_AI_Governance – المادة 5.2.2*\\n\\n4. **صيانة “حزم الأدلة النموذجية” (Model Evidence Packs)**  \\n   - يجب على الإدارة العليا والهيئات الحاكمة ضمان أن تُحافظ على حزم الأدلة النموذجية لكافة النماذج من المستوى\\u202f1\\u202fو\\u202f2، وتُحدّثها بعد أي تغيير مادي في النموذج، وتُتاح للمراجعين والجهات التنظيمية عند الطلب.  \\n   - *المصدر: FAB_Model_Risk_Management_Framework_v3.1 – القسم\\u202f3*'}]}"}
{"ts": "2026-06-26T11:58:27+0530", "level": "INFO", "logger": "agent_framework", "trace_id": "85c81cc953f8180d43a7e5def0dd3db3", "span_id": "8dd3de969b738ec4", "parent_span_id": "-", "request_id": "6D027613", "msg": "{'role': 'assistant', 'parts': [{'type': 'tool_call', 'id': 'fc_f97fe62b-4231-41ed-b24c-eccb3abd13e2', 'name': 'query_knowledge_base', 'arguments': '{\"question\":\"When should senior management be involved regarding model risks?\"}'}]}"}
{"ts": "2026-06-26T11:58:27+0530", "level": "INFO", "logger": "agent_framework", "trace_id": "85c81cc953f8180d43a7e5def0dd3db3", "span_id": "8dd3de969b738ec4", "parent_span_id": "-", "request_id": "6D027613", "msg": "{'role': 'tool', 'parts': [{'type': 'tool_call_response', 'id': 'fc_f97fe62b-4231-41ed-b24c-eccb3abd13e2', 'response': 'Based on the FAB Model Risk Management Framework and the Central Bank of the UAE\\'s (CBUAE) AI Governance Circular, senior management and the Board must be involved in specific governance, oversight, and escalation scenarios regarding model risks.\\n\\nKey triggers and requirements for senior management involvement include:\\n\\n**1. Annual Governance Policy Approval (Board Level)**\\nThe Board of Directors must adopt, maintain, and formally review and re-approve a written AI Governance Policy at least annually. This policy must define the bank\\'s risk appetite for AI-related risks, accountability structures, human oversight requirements, and regulatory reporting obligations.\\n* *Source: [CBUAE_Circular_2024_BSE_047_AI_Governance · Article 2.1.1]*\\n\\n**2. Designation of Senior Oversight (Executive Level)**\\nA designated member of senior management—holding a position no lower than the Chief Risk Officer—must be formally appointed as the \"AI Risk Officer.\" This individual is responsible for overseeing the implementation of governance standards and model risk management protocols.\\n* *Source: [CBUAE_Circular_2024_BSE_047_AI_Governance · Article 2.1.2]*\\n\\n**3. Escalation of Systematic Model Overrides (Performance Monitoring)**\\nSenior management (specifically the AI Risk Officer) must be involved when models are systematically failing or bypassing human use. Any systematic pattern of overrides—defined as override rates exceeding **25% of recommendations over a rolling 90-day period**—must be reported to the AI Risk Officer and reviewed as a critical indicator of potential model performance degradation.\\n* *Source: [CBUAE_Circular_2024_BSE_047_AI_Governance · Article 5.2.2]*\\n\\n**4. Maintenance of Model Evidence Packs**\\nSenior management and governance bodies must ensure that a Model Evidence Pack (MEP) is maintained for all Tier 1 and Tier 2 models. These packs, which include validation records, known failure modes, and performance metrics, must be kept updated following any material model changes and made available to auditors and regulators upon request.\\n* *Source: [FAB_Model_Risk_Management_Framework_v3.1 · Section 3]*'}]}"}
{"ts": "2026-06-26T11:58:27+0530", "level": "INFO", "logger": "agent_framework", "trace_id": "85c81cc953f8180d43a7e5def0dd3db3", "span_id": "8dd3de969b738ec4", "parent_span_id": "-", "request_id": "6D027613", "msg": "{'role': 'assistant', 'parts': [{'type': 'text', 'content': '**متى يجب إشراك الإدارة العليا فيما يتعلق بمخاطر النماذج**\\n\\n1. **الموافقة السنوية على سياسات الحوكمة**  \\n   - يجب على مجلس الإدارة اعتماد\\u202f/\\u202fمراجعة\\u202f/\\u202fإعادة اعتماد سياسات حوكمة الذكاء الاصطناعي (AI Governance Policy) كتابةً على الأقل مرة كل عام.  \\n   - *المصدر: CBUAE_Circular_2024_BSE_047_AI_Governance – المادة 2.1.1*\\n\\n2. **تعيين مسؤول مخاطر الذكاء الاصطناعي**  \\n   - يجب تعيين عضو من الإدارة العليا (ليس أدنى من رئيس قسم المخاطر – CRO) كـ “مسؤول مخاطر الذكاء الاصطناعي” (AI Risk Officer) لتولي الإشراف على تنفيذ معايير الحوكمة وإدارة مخاطر النماذج.  \\n   - *المصدر: CBUAE_Circular_2024_BSE_047_AI_Governance – المادة 2.1.2*\\n\\n3. **تصعيد حالات تجاوز نظامية للنماذج (Performance Monitoring)**  \\n   - عندما تتجاوز معدلات تجاوز توصيات النموذج\\u202f25\\u202f٪ على مدى فترة متداولة تبلغ 90 يوماً، يجب إبلاغ مسؤول مخاطر الذكاء الاصطناعي وإجراء مراجعة إدارية لتقييم تدهور أداء النموذج.  \\n   - *المصدر: CBUAE_Circular_2024_BSE_047_AI_Governance – المادة 5.2.2*\\n\\n4. **صيانة “حزم الأدلة النموذجية” (Model Evidence Packs)**  \\n   - يجب على الإدارة العليا والهيئات الحاكمة ضمان أن تُحافظ على حزم الأدلة النموذجية لكافة النماذج من المستوى\\u202f1\\u202fو\\u202f2، وتُحدّثها بعد أي تغيير مادي في النموذج، وتُتاح للمراجعين والجهات التنظيمية عند الطلب.  \\n   - *المصدر: FAB_Model_Risk_Management_Framework_v3.1 – القسم\\u202f3*'}]}"}
