{"ts": "2026-06-29T14:50:18+0530", "level": "INFO", "logger": "agent_framework", "trace_id": "c354ca0c5c287727de6da7c9164b85a4", "span_id": "02ef520024e30040", "parent_span_id": "-", "request_id": "F3F5992B", "msg": "{'role': 'assistant', 'parts': [{'type': 'tool_call', 'id': 'fc_23a6a732-9ba5-499e-9c56-e101ccf41554', 'name': 'query_knowledge_base', 'arguments': '{\"question\":\"What is the pricing floor for BB-rated AED corporate loans?\"}'}]}"}
{"ts": "2026-06-29T14:50:18+0530", "level": "INFO", "logger": "agent_framework", "trace_id": "c354ca0c5c287727de6da7c9164b85a4", "span_id": "02ef520024e30040", "parent_span_id": "-", "request_id": "F3F5992B", "msg": "{'role': 'tool', 'parts': [{'type': 'tool_call_response', 'id': 'fc_23a6a732-9ba5-499e-9c56-e101ccf41554', 'response': \"Based on the **FAB Credit Pricing Policy v2.4**, the minimum pricing floor for a **BB-rated corporate term loan** is determined by the facility's tenor and is expressed as a spread over the applicable Funds Transfer Pricing (FTP) rate. \\n\\nThe specific floor spreads are as follows:\\n\\n| Facility Tenor | Minimum Pricing Floor (Spread over FTP) |\\n| :--- | :--- |\\n| ≤ 1 Year | 165 bps |\\n| 1–3 Years | 210 bps |\\n| 3–5 Years | 260 bps |\\n| > 5 Years | 320 bps |\\n\\n**Key Policy Notes:**\\n* **All-in Rate Calculation:** The total minimum all-in rate must not fall below **FTP + the stated floor spread**. FTP rates are matched to the facility's tenor and published monthly by Treasury `[FAB_Credit_Pricing_Policy_v2.4 · Section 3.1]`.\\n* **Relationship Value Adjustment:** Where a client demonstrates material cross-sell contribution (documented annual revenue > AED 500,000 across the relationship), the required margin floor may be reduced by up to **25 bps**, subject to relevant credit authority approval and annual review `[FAB_Credit_Pricing_Policy_v2.4 · Section 2.4]`.\\n* **Pricing Exceptions:** Pricing below these floors is prohibited without a formal Pricing Exception. Exceptions require documented commercial rationale, RAROC sensitivity analysis, and tiered committee approval based on the deviation from the floor `[FAB_Credit_Pricing_Policy_v2.4 · Section 6]`.\\n\\n*Source: FAB_Credit_Pricing_Policy_v2.4, Sections 3.1 (Table 3.1), 2.4, & 6*\"}]}"}
{"ts": "2026-06-29T14:50:20+0530", "level": "INFO", "logger": "agent_framework", "trace_id": "c354ca0c5c287727de6da7c9164b85a4", "span_id": "02ef520024e30040", "parent_span_id": "-", "request_id": "F3F5992B", "msg": "{'role': 'assistant', 'parts': [{'type': 'text', 'content': '**Pricing Floor for BB‑rated AED Corporate Loans (per FAB Credit Pricing Policy v2.4)**  \\n\\n| Facility Tenor | Minimum Pricing Floor (Spread over FTP) |\\n|----------------|-------------------------------------------|\\n| ≤\\u202f1\\u202fYear       | 165\\u202fbps                                   |\\n| 1\\u202f–\\u202f3\\u202fYears    | 210\\u202fbps                                   |\\n| 3\\u202f–\\u202f5\\u202fYears    | 260\\u202fbps                                   |\\n| >\\u202f5\\u202fYears      | 320\\u202fbps                                   |\\n\\n**Key Policy Details**  \\n\\n- **All‑in Rate Calculation:** The all‑in rate may not fall below **FTP\\u202f+\\u202fthe floor spread** shown above. FTP rates are tenor‑matched and published monthly by Treasury. *(FAB_Credit_Pricing_Policy_v2.4 – Section\\u202f3.1, Table\\u202f3.1)*  \\n- **Relationship Value Adjustment:** If the client contributes material cross‑sell revenue (annual revenue\\u202f>\\u202fAED\\u202f500,000 across the relationship), the floor may be reduced by up to **25\\u202fbps**, subject to credit authority approval. *(FAB_Credit_Pricing_Policy_v2.4 – Section\\u202f2.4)*  \\n- **Pricing Exceptions:** Any price below these floors requires a formal Pricing Exception, including commercial rationale, RAROC sensitivity analysis, and tiered committee approval based on the deviation. *(FAB_Credit_Pricing_Policy_v2.4 – Section\\u202f6)*  \\n\\n*Source: FAB_Credit_Pricing_Policy_v2.4, Sections\\u202f3.1 (Table\\u202f3.1),\\u202f2.4,\\u202fand\\u202f6.*'}]}"}
