{"ts": "2026-06-29T14:58:43+0530", "level": "INFO", "logger": "agent_framework", "trace_id": "6321fb9e6b271fed80062db6a0a2454c", "span_id": "62ec60f07f1d4ce5", "parent_span_id": "-", "request_id": "3EA99AC3", "msg": "{'role': 'tool', 'parts': [{'type': 'tool_call_response', 'id': 'fc_29885a89-8019-4233-a526-2402d49214a5', 'response': 'Here is the complete loan deal data retrieved for customer **CUST002** (Falcon Steel Industries):\\n\\n| Field | Value |\\n|:---|:---|\\n| **Deal ID** | DEAL005 |\\n| **Deal Date** | 2025-10-24 00:00:00 |\\n| **Customer ID** | CUST002 |\\n| **Customer Name** | Falcon Steel Industries |\\n| **Customer Segment** | Corporate |\\n| **Risk Category** | Low |\\n| **Internal Rating** | A |\\n| **Product ID** | PROD002 |\\n| **Product Name** | Term Loan |\\n| **Product Type** | Loan |\\n| **Pricing Method** | Floating |\\n| **Max Discount Allowed %** | 0.6 |\\n| **Currency** | AED |\\n| **Tenor** | 12M |\\n| **Requested Amount** | 58,000,000 |\\n| **Funding Cost % (FTP)** | 5.55 |\\n| **Standard Margin'}]}"}
