{"ts": "2026-06-29T14:59:44+0530", "level": "INFO", "logger": "agent_framework", "trace_id": "6321fb9e6b271fed80062db6a0a2454c", "span_id": "c0d8280e0e985019", "parent_span_id": "-", "request_id": "3EA99AC3", "msg": "{'role': 'tool', 'parts': [{'type': 'tool_call_response', 'id': 'fc_4424533a-4616-4f13-baf3-f7fab84c72e6', 'response': 'Here is the complete deal-level margin analysis data returned for customer CUST002 (Deal ID: DEAL005):\\n\\n| Field | Value |\\n| :--- | :--- |\\n| deal_id | DEAL005 |\\n| deal_date | 2025-10-24 00:00:00 |\\n| customer_id | CUST002 |\\n| customer_name | Falcon Steel Industries |\\n| customer_segment | Corporate |\\n| region | Abu Dhabi |\\n| risk_category | Low |\\n| internal_rating | A |\\n| product_id | PROD002 |\\n| product_type | Loan |\\n| currency | AED |\\n| tenor | 12M |\\n| requested_amount | 58,000,000 |\\n| funding_cost_pct | 5.55% |\\n| risk_premium_pct | 0.1% |\\n| relationship_discount_pct | 0.45% |\\n| recommended_price_pct | 7.3% |\\n| final_approved_price_pct | 7.25% |\\n| expected_margin_pct | 1.35% |\\n| deal_outcome | Won |\\n| benchmark_rate_pct_treasury | 5.35% |\\n| funding_cost_pct_treasury | 5.55% |\\n| net_margin_pct | 1.15% |\\n| spread_over_benchmark_pct | 1.9% |\\n| margin_vs_recommended_pct | -0.05% |\\n\\n**Answer:**\\nThe offered spread over FTP (Funds Transfer Pricing) for this deal is **1.70%**. This is calculated by subtracting the internal funding cost/FTP rate (`funding_cost_pct_treasury`: 5.55%) from the final approved price (`final_approved_price_pct`: 7.25%). \\n\\n*Source: margin_analysis*'}]}"}
{"ts": "2026-06-29T14:59:44+0530", "level": "INFO", "logger": "agent_framework", "trace_id": "6321fb9e6b271fed80062db6a0a2454c", "span_id": "c0d8280e0e985019", "parent_span_id": "-", "request_id": "3EA99AC3", "msg": "{'role': 'assistant', 'parts': [{'type': 'tool_call', 'id': 'fc_c61d5e9f-6840-4799-b07c-d9c961ef27ab', 'name': 'query_knowledge_base', 'arguments': '{\"question\":\"What is the pricing floor (minimum spread over FTP) for A-rated AED corporate loans according to FAB Credit Pricing Policy?\"}'}]}"}
