{"ts": "2026-07-03T10:08:10+0530", "level": "INFO", "logger": "agent_framework", "trace_id": "311f01d44fd7a431071c05f809ebe8da", "span_id": "d01d9df985dca1e9", "parent_span_id": "-", "request_id": "0A7DC269", "msg": "{'role': 'tool', 'parts': [{'type': 'tool_call_response', 'id': 'fc_0a7f225e-499c-4667-a5c3-741d3a23e89c', 'response': 'Based on the retrieved data, here are the specific details for **CUST001 (Al Noor Trading LLC)**:\\n\\n* **Credit Rating**: `BBB` (Internal Rating)\\n* **Recommended Interest Rates** (per deal):\\n  * DEAL033: `6.85%`\\n  * DEAL040: `5.5%`\\n  * DEAL041: `6.7%`\\n* **Pricing Limits** (Policy constraints per deal):\\n  * DEAL033: Max Discount Allowed `0.5%`, Policy Max Discount `0.25%`, Policy Min Margin `1.75%`, Policy Min Expected Margin `0.75%`\\n  * DEAL040: Max Discount Allowed `0.25%`, Policy Max Discount `0.25%`, Policy Min Margin `0.65%`, Policy Min Expected Margin `0.1%`\\n  * DEAL041: Max Discount Allowed `0.5%`, Policy Max Discount `0.25%`, Policy Min Margin `1.75%`, Policy Min Expected Margin `0.75%`\\n\\n---\\n### Complete Source Data\\n\\n**Source: customer_360**\\n| Field | Value |\\n| :--- | :--- |\\n| customer_id | CUST001 |\\n| customer_name | Al Noor Trading LLC |\\n| customer_segment | SME |\\n| industry | Trading |\\n| region | Dubai |\\n| preferred_currency | AED |\\n| risk_category | Medium |\\n| internal_rating | BBB |\\n| relationship_tenure_years | 5 |\\n| relationship_status | Existing |\\n| relationship_discount_pct | 0.25 |\\n| annual_revenue_aed | 18000000 |\\n| debt_to_equity_ratio | 0.0 |\\n| credit_score | 690 |\\n| existing_exposure_aed | 3500000 |\\n| total_deals | 3 |\\n| won_deals | 2.0 |\\n| lost_deals | 1.0 |\\n| total_deal_volume_aed | 123200000.0 |\\n| avg_deal_size_aed | 41066666.6667 |\\n| avg_expected_margin_pct | 0.4833333333333334 |\\n| avg_approved_price_pct | 6.25 |\\n| avg_relationship_discount_pct | 0.25 |\\n| last_deal_date | 20'}]}"}
