{"ts": "2026-07-03T10:11:27+0530", "level": "INFO", "logger": "agent_framework", "trace_id": "311f01d44fd7a431071c05f809ebe8da", "span_id": "31f6c6ad5a2cf8d5", "parent_span_id": "-", "request_id": "0A7DC269", "msg": "{'role': 'assistant', 'parts': [{'type': 'tool_call', 'id': 'fc_0a7f225e-499c-4667-a5c3-741d3a23e89c', 'name': 'query_structured_data', 'arguments': '{\"question\":\"Provide CUST001\\'s recommended interest rate, credit rating, and any pricing limits.\"}'}]}"}
{"ts": "2026-07-03T10:11:27+0530", "level": "INFO", "logger": "agent_framework", "trace_id": "311f01d44fd7a431071c05f809ebe8da", "span_id": "31f6c6ad5a2cf8d5", "parent_span_id": "-", "request_id": "0A7DC269", "msg": "{'role': 'tool', 'parts': [{'type': 'tool_call_response', 'id': 'fc_0a7f225e-499c-4667-a5c3-741d3a23e89c', 'response': 'Based on the retrieved data, here are the specific details for **CUST001 (Al Noor Trading LLC)**:\\n\\n* **Credit Rating**: `BBB` (Internal Rating)\\n* **Recommended Interest Rates** (per deal):\\n  * DEAL033: `6.85%`\\n  * DEAL040: `5.5%`\\n  * DEAL041: `6.7%`\\n* **Pricing Limits** (Policy constraints per deal):\\n  * DEAL033: Max Discount Allowed `0.5%`, Policy Max Discount `0.25%`, Policy Min Margin `1.75%`, Policy Min Expected Margin `0.75%`\\n  * DEAL040: Max Discount Allowed `0.25%`, Policy Max Discount `0.25%`, Policy Min Margin `0.65%`, Policy Min Expected Margin `0.1%`\\n  * DEAL041: Max Discount Allowed `0.5%`, Policy Max Discount `0.25%`, Policy Min Margin `1.75%`, Policy Min Expected Margin `0.75%`\\n\\n---\\n### Complete Source Data\\n\\n**Source: customer_360**\\n| Field | Value |\\n| :--- | :--- |\\n| customer_id | CUST001 |\\n| customer_name | Al Noor Trading LLC |\\n| customer_segment | SME |\\n| industry | Trading |\\n| region | Dubai |\\n| preferred_currency | AED |\\n| risk_category | Medium |\\n| internal_rating | BBB |\\n| relationship_tenure_years | 5 |\\n| relationship_status | Existing |\\n| relationship_discount_pct | 0.25 |\\n| annual_revenue_aed | 18000000 |\\n| debt_to_equity_ratio | 0.0 |\\n| credit_score | 690 |\\n| existing_exposure_aed | 3500000 |\\n| total_deals | 3 |\\n| won_deals | 2.0 |\\n| lost_deals | 1.0 |\\n| total_deal_volume_aed | 123200000.0 |\\n| avg_deal_size_aed | 41066666.6667 |\\n| avg_expected_margin_pct | 0.4833333333333334 |\\n| avg_approved_price_pct | 6.25 |\\n| avg_relationship_discount_pct | 0.25 |\\n| last_deal_date | 20'}]}"}
{"ts": "2026-07-03T10:11:27+0530", "level": "INFO", "logger": "agent_framework", "trace_id": "311f01d44fd7a431071c05f809ebe8da", "span_id": "31f6c6ad5a2cf8d5", "parent_span_id": "-", "request_id": "0A7DC269", "msg": "{'role': 'assistant', 'parts': [{'type': 'tool_call', 'id': 'fc_ec962a9f-b569-4b4d-996d-f033ab9dc473', 'name': 'query_knowledge_base', 'arguments': '{\"question\":\"What is the pricing floor (minimum interest rate) for a BBB-rated AED loan according to FAB policy?\"}'}]}"}
{"ts": "2026-07-03T10:11:27+0530", "level": "INFO", "logger": "agent_framework", "trace_id": "311f01d44fd7a431071c05f809ebe8da", "span_id": "31f6c6ad5a2cf8d5", "parent_span_id": "-", "request_id": "0A7DC269", "msg": "{'role': 'tool', 'parts': [{'type': 'tool_call_response', 'id': 'fc_ec962a9f-b569-4b4d-996d-f033ab9dc473', 'response': \"Based on FAB's Credit Pricing Policy (v2.4), the pricing floor for a BBB-rated AED loan is determined as a **spread over the internal Funds Transfer Pricing (FTP) rate**, rather than a fixed interest rate. \\n\\nThe minimum required spread for a **BBB-rated corporate term loan** varies by tenor (**Section 3.1**):\\n\\n| Facility Tenor | Minimum Pricing Floor (Spread over FTP) |\\n| :--- | :--- |\\n| **≤ 1 Year** | 115 bps |\\n| **1 – 3 Years** | 145 bps |\\n| **3 – 5 Years** | 180 bps |\\n| **> 5 Years** | 220 bps |\\n\\n**Calculating the All-In Minimum Rate:**\\nTo determine the actual minimum interest rate, add the applicable spread to the current AED FTP rate (published monthly by FAB Treasury). \\n> *Poly Example:* If the internal FTP rate for a 4-year AED loan is 4.85%, the minimum floor spread is 180 bps. The minimum all-in rate would be 4.85% + 1.80% = **6.65%**.\\n\\n*Note: If the facility is a Revolving Credit Facility (RCF) rather than a term loan, the minimum drawn margin floor for a BBB rating is 110 bps over FTP, in addition to a 15 bps facility fee floor (**Section 3.2**).*\\n\\n📖 **Source:** FAB_Credit_Pricing_Policy_v2.4 | **Clauses:** 3.1 (Corporate Term Loans) & 3.2 (RCFs)\"}]}"}
{"ts": "2026-07-03T10:11:31+0530", "level": "INFO", "logger": "agent_framework", "trace_id": "311f01d44fd7a431071c05f809ebe8da", "span_id": "31f6c6ad5a2cf8d5", "parent_span_id": "-", "request_id": "0A7DC269", "msg": "{'role': 'assistant', 'parts': [{'type': 'text', 'content': '**Customer:** CUST001 – Al\\u202fNoor Trading LLC  \\n**Internal Rating:** BBB  \\n\\n---\\n\\n### Structured Deal Data (Data Layer)\\n\\n| Deal ID | Recommended\\u202fInterest\\u202fRate | Pricing Limits (Policy) |\\n|---------|---------------------------|--------------------------|\\n| DEAL033 | 6.85\\u202f% | Max Discount\\u202f0.5\\u202f% • Policy\\u202fMax\\u202fDiscount\\u202f0.25\\u202f% • Min\\u202fMargin\\u202f1.75\\u202f% • Min\\u202fExpected\\u202fMargin\\u202f0.75\\u202f% |\\n| DEAL040 | 5.50\\u202f% | Max Discount\\u202f0.25\\u202f% • Policy\\u202fMax\\u202fDiscount\\u202f0.25\\u202f% • Min\\u202fMargin\\u202f0.65\\u202f% • Min\\u202fExpected\\u202fMargin\\u202f0.10\\u202f% |\\n| DEAL041 | 6.70\\u202f% | Max Discount\\u202f0.5\\u202f% • Policy\\u202fMax\\u202fDiscount\\u202f0.25\\u202f% • Min\\u202fMargin\\u202f1.75\\u202f% • Min\\u202fExpected\\u202fMargin\\u202f0.75\\u202f% |\\n\\n*Source:* **query_structured_data – customer_360** (fields listed above).  \\n\\n---\\n\\n### Policy Floor for a BBB‑Rated AED Loan (RAG)\\n\\nFAB Credit Pricing Policy\\u202fv2.4 – **Section\\u202f3.1 (Corporate Term Loans)**  \\n\\n| Facility Tenor | Minimum Pricing Floor (Spread over internal FTP) |\\n|----------------|--------------------------------------------------|\\n| ≤\\u202f1\\u202fYear       | 115\\u202fbps |\\n| 1\\u202f–\\u202f3\\u202fYears    | 145\\u202fbps |\\n| 3\\u202f–\\u202f5\\u202fYears    | 180\\u202fbps |\\n| >\\u202f5\\u202fYears      | 220\\u202fbps |\\n\\n> **All‑in minimum rate** = FTP\\u202frate\\u202f(\\u200bpublished monthly)\\u202f+\\u202fapplicable spread.  \\n> *Example:* FTP\\u202f=\\u202f4.85\\u202f% for a 4‑year loan → floor\\u202f=\\u202f4.85\\u202f%\\u202f+\\u202f1.80\\u202f%\\u202f=\\u202f**6.65\\u202f%**.  \\n\\n*Source:* **query_knowledge_base – FAB_Credit_Pricing_Policy_v2.4**, Clauses\\u202f3.1 &\\u202f3.2.  \\n\\n---\\n\\n### Compliance Check & Recommendation\\n\\n| Deal ID | Recommended Rate | Assumed Tenor* | Minimum Floor (Spread\\u202f+\\u202fFTP) | Verdict |\\n|---------|------------------|----------------|------------------------------|---------|\\n| DEAL040 | 5.50\\u202f% | 1‑3\\u202fYears | FTP\\u202f+\\u202f145\\u202fbps. If FTP\\u202f≤\\u202f5.35\\u202f% → floor\\u202f≤\\u202f5.50\\u202f% → **Compliant**. | Likely compliant for short‑term facilities where FTP is ≤\\u202f5.35\\u202f%. |\\n| DEAL033 | 6.85\\u202f% | 3‑5\\u202fYears | FTP\\u202f+\\u202f180\\u202fbps. If FTP\\u202f≤\\u202f6.65\\u202f% → floor\\u202f≤\\u202f6.85\\u202f% → **Compliant**. | Compliant for medium‑term loans with FTP ≤\\u202f6.65\\u202f%. |\\n| DEAL041 | 6.70\\u202f% | 3‑5\\u202fYears | Same floor as DEAL033. If FTP\\u202f≤\\u202f6.50\\u202f% → floor\\u202f≤\\u202f6.70\\u202f% → **Compliant**. | Generally compliant; check FTP if it is >\\u202f6.50\\u202f%. |\\n\\n\\\\*Tenor is not stored in the deal record; the appropriate floor depends on the loan’s maturity.  \\n\\n**Recommendation**\\n\\n1. **Determine the intended loan tenor** (e.g., 1–3\\u202fyears, 3–5\\u202fyears).  \\n2. **Retrieve the current AED FTP rate** for that tenor (published by FAB Treasury).  \\n3. **Apply the spread from the policy** (145\\u202fbps for 1‑3\\u202fyr, 180\\u202fbps for 3‑5\\u202fyr, etc.).  \\n4. **Select the lowest recommended rate that meets or exceeds the calculated floor**:  \\n   - For a **short‑term (≤\\u202f3\\u202fyr) loan**, the 5.50\\u202f% rate (DEAL040) is acceptable provided FTP\\u202f≤\\u202f5.35\\u202f%.  \\n   - For a **medium‑term (3‑5\\u202fyr) loan**, the 6.70\\u202f% rate (DEAL041) or 6.85\\u202f% rate (DEAL033) will be compliant if FTP\\u202f≤\\u202f6.50\\u202f%–6.65\\u202f% respectively.  \\n\\nIf the current FTP is higher than the thresholds above, you will need to **offer a higher rate** (e.g., add the required spread to the FTP) to stay within policy limits.\\n\\n---\\n\\n### Action Steps for the Banker\\n\\n1. **Ask the client** for the desired loan tenor (or refer to the deal brief).  \\n2. **Check the latest AED FTP rate** for that tenor.  \\n3. **Calculate the minimum all‑in rate** using the spread table.  \\n4. **Offer the recommended rate** that is **at or above** the calculated floor and respects the deal‑specific pricing limits (max discount, min margin).  \\n\\nThis ensures the offer is both **policy‑compliant** and aligned with FAB’s internal pricing recommendations for CUST001.'}]}"}
{"ts": "2026-07-03T10:11:31+0530", "level": "INFO", "logger": "agent_framework", "trace_id": "311f01d44fd7a431071c05f809ebe8da", "span_id": "e402889db848251d", "parent_span_id": "-", "request_id": "0A7DC269", "msg": "{'role': 'assistant', 'parts': [{'type': 'tool_call', 'id': 'fc_0a7f225e-499c-4667-a5c3-741d3a23e89c', 'name': 'query_structured_data', 'arguments': '{\"question\":\"Provide CUST001\\'s recommended interest rate, credit rating, and any pricing limits.\"}'}]}"}
{"ts": "2026-07-03T10:11:31+0530", "level": "INFO", "logger": "agent_framework", "trace_id": "311f01d44fd7a431071c05f809ebe8da", "span_id": "e402889db848251d", "parent_span_id": "-", "request_id": "0A7DC269", "msg": "{'role': 'tool', 'parts': [{'type': 'tool_call_response', 'id': 'fc_0a7f225e-499c-4667-a5c3-741d3a23e89c', 'response': 'Based on the retrieved data, here are the specific details for **CUST001 (Al Noor Trading LLC)**:\\n\\n* **Credit Rating**: `BBB` (Internal Rating)\\n* **Recommended Interest Rates** (per deal):\\n  * DEAL033: `6.85%`\\n  * DEAL040: `5.5%`\\n  * DEAL041: `6.7%`\\n* **Pricing Limits** (Policy constraints per deal):\\n  * DEAL033: Max Discount Allowed `0.5%`, Policy Max Discount `0.25%`, Policy Min Margin `1.75%`, Policy Min Expected Margin `0.75%`\\n  * DEAL040: Max Discount Allowed `0.25%`, Policy Max Discount `0.25%`, Policy Min Margin `0.65%`, Policy Min Expected Margin `0.1%`\\n  * DEAL041: Max Discount Allowed `0.5%`, Policy Max Discount `0.25%`, Policy Min Margin `1.75%`, Policy Min Expected Margin `0.75%`\\n\\n---\\n### Complete Source Data\\n\\n**Source: customer_360**\\n| Field | Value |\\n| :--- | :--- |\\n| customer_id | CUST001 |\\n| customer_name | Al Noor Trading LLC |\\n| customer_segment | SME |\\n| industry | Trading |\\n| region | Dubai |\\n| preferred_currency | AED |\\n| risk_category | Medium |\\n| internal_rating | BBB |\\n| relationship_tenure_years | 5 |\\n| relationship_status | Existing |\\n| relationship_discount_pct | 0.25 |\\n| annual_revenue_aed | 18000000 |\\n| debt_to_equity_ratio | 0.0 |\\n| credit_score | 690 |\\n| existing_exposure_aed | 3500000 |\\n| total_deals | 3 |\\n| won_deals | 2.0 |\\n| lost_deals | 1.0 |\\n| total_deal_volume_aed | 123200000.0 |\\n| avg_deal_size_aed | 41066666.6667 |\\n| avg_expected_margin_pct | 0.4833333333333334 |\\n| avg_approved_price_pct | 6.25 |\\n| avg_relationship_discount_pct | 0.25 |\\n| last_deal_date | 20'}]}"}
{"ts": "2026-07-03T10:11:31+0530", "level": "INFO", "logger": "agent_framework", "trace_id": "311f01d44fd7a431071c05f809ebe8da", "span_id": "e402889db848251d", "parent_span_id": "-", "request_id": "0A7DC269", "msg": "{'role': 'assistant', 'parts': [{'type': 'tool_call', 'id': 'fc_ec962a9f-b569-4b4d-996d-f033ab9dc473', 'name': 'query_knowledge_base', 'arguments': '{\"question\":\"What is the pricing floor (minimum interest rate) for a BBB-rated AED loan according to FAB policy?\"}'}]}"}
{"ts": "2026-07-03T10:11:31+0530", "level": "INFO", "logger": "agent_framework", "trace_id": "311f01d44fd7a431071c05f809ebe8da", "span_id": "e402889db848251d", "parent_span_id": "-", "request_id": "0A7DC269", "msg": "{'role': 'tool', 'parts': [{'type': 'tool_call_response', 'id': 'fc_ec962a9f-b569-4b4d-996d-f033ab9dc473', 'response': \"Based on FAB's Credit Pricing Policy (v2.4), the pricing floor for a BBB-rated AED loan is determined as a **spread over the internal Funds Transfer Pricing (FTP) rate**, rather than a fixed interest rate. \\n\\nThe minimum required spread for a **BBB-rated corporate term loan** varies by tenor (**Section 3.1**):\\n\\n| Facility Tenor | Minimum Pricing Floor (Spread over FTP) |\\n| :--- | :--- |\\n| **≤ 1 Year** | 115 bps |\\n| **1 – 3 Years** | 145 bps |\\n| **3 – 5 Years** | 180 bps |\\n| **> 5 Years** | 220 bps |\\n\\n**Calculating the All-In Minimum Rate:**\\nTo determine the actual minimum interest rate, add the applicable spread to the current AED FTP rate (published monthly by FAB Treasury). \\n> *Poly Example:* If the internal FTP rate for a 4-year AED loan is 4.85%, the minimum floor spread is 180 bps. The minimum all-in rate would be 4.85% + 1.80% = **6.65%**.\\n\\n*Note: If the facility is a Revolving Credit Facility (RCF) rather than a term loan, the minimum drawn margin floor for a BBB rating is 110 bps over FTP, in addition to a 15 bps facility fee floor (**Section 3.2**).*\\n\\n📖 **Source:** FAB_Credit_Pricing_Policy_v2.4 | **Clauses:** 3.1 (Corporate Term Loans) & 3.2 (RCFs)\"}]}"}
{"ts": "2026-07-03T10:11:31+0530", "level": "INFO", "logger": "agent_framework", "trace_id": "311f01d44fd7a431071c05f809ebe8da", "span_id": "e402889db848251d", "parent_span_id": "-", "request_id": "0A7DC269", "msg": "{'role': 'assistant', 'parts': [{'type': 'text', 'content': '**Customer:** CUST001 – Al\\u202fNoor Trading LLC  \\n**Internal Rating:** BBB  \\n\\n---\\n\\n### Structured Deal Data (Data Layer)\\n\\n| Deal ID | Recommended\\u202fInterest\\u202fRate | Pricing Limits (Policy) |\\n|---------|---------------------------|--------------------------|\\n| DEAL033 | 6.85\\u202f% | Max Discount\\u202f0.5\\u202f% • Policy\\u202fMax\\u202fDiscount\\u202f0.25\\u202f% • Min\\u202fMargin\\u202f1.75\\u202f% • Min\\u202fExpected\\u202fMargin\\u202f0.75\\u202f% |\\n| DEAL040 | 5.50\\u202f% | Max Discount\\u202f0.25\\u202f% • Policy\\u202fMax\\u202fDiscount\\u202f0.25\\u202f% • Min\\u202fMargin\\u202f0.65\\u202f% • Min\\u202fExpected\\u202fMargin\\u202f0.10\\u202f% |\\n| DEAL041 | 6.70\\u202f% | Max Discount\\u202f0.5\\u202f% • Policy\\u202fMax\\u202fDiscount\\u202f0.25\\u202f% • Min\\u202fMargin\\u202f1.75\\u202f% • Min\\u202fExpected\\u202fMargin\\u202f0.75\\u202f% |\\n\\n*Source:* **query_structured_data – customer_360** (fields listed above).  \\n\\n---\\n\\n### Policy Floor for a BBB‑Rated AED Loan (RAG)\\n\\nFAB Credit Pricing Policy\\u202fv2.4 – **Section\\u202f3.1 (Corporate Term Loans)**  \\n\\n| Facility Tenor | Minimum Pricing Floor (Spread over internal FTP) |\\n|----------------|--------------------------------------------------|\\n| ≤\\u202f1\\u202fYear       | 115\\u202fbps |\\n| 1\\u202f–\\u202f3\\u202fYears    | 145\\u202fbps |\\n| 3\\u202f–\\u202f5\\u202fYears    | 180\\u202fbps |\\n| >\\u202f5\\u202fYears      | 220\\u202fbps |\\n\\n> **All‑in minimum rate** = FTP\\u202frate\\u202f(\\u200bpublished monthly)\\u202f+\\u202fapplicable spread.  \\n> *Example:* FTP\\u202f=\\u202f4.85\\u202f% for a 4‑year loan → floor\\u202f=\\u202f4.85\\u202f%\\u202f+\\u202f1.80\\u202f%\\u202f=\\u202f**6.65\\u202f%**.  \\n\\n*Source:* **query_knowledge_base – FAB_Credit_Pricing_Policy_v2.4**, Clauses\\u202f3.1 &\\u202f3.2.  \\n\\n---\\n\\n### Compliance Check & Recommendation\\n\\n| Deal ID | Recommended Rate | Assumed Tenor* | Minimum Floor (Spread\\u202f+\\u202fFTP) | Verdict |\\n|---------|------------------|----------------|------------------------------|---------|\\n| DEAL040 | 5.50\\u202f% | 1‑3\\u202fYears | FTP\\u202f+\\u202f145\\u202fbps. If FTP\\u202f≤\\u202f5.35\\u202f% → floor\\u202f≤\\u202f5.50\\u202f% → **Compliant**. | Likely compliant for short‑term facilities where FTP is ≤\\u202f5.35\\u202f%. |\\n| DEAL033 | 6.85\\u202f% | 3‑5\\u202fYears | FTP\\u202f+\\u202f180\\u202fbps. If FTP\\u202f≤\\u202f6.65\\u202f% → floor\\u202f≤\\u202f6.85\\u202f% → **Compliant**. | Compliant for medium‑term loans with FTP ≤\\u202f6.65\\u202f%. |\\n| DEAL041 | 6.70\\u202f% | 3‑5\\u202fYears | Same floor as DEAL033. If FTP\\u202f≤\\u202f6.50\\u202f% → floor\\u202f≤\\u202f6.70\\u202f% → **Compliant**. | Generally compliant; check FTP if it is >\\u202f6.50\\u202f%. |\\n\\n\\\\*Tenor is not stored in the deal record; the appropriate floor depends on the loan’s maturity.  \\n\\n**Recommendation**\\n\\n1. **Determine the intended loan tenor** (e.g., 1–3\\u202fyears, 3–5\\u202fyears).  \\n2. **Retrieve the current AED FTP rate** for that tenor (published by FAB Treasury).  \\n3. **Apply the spread from the policy** (145\\u202fbps for 1‑3\\u202fyr, 180\\u202fbps for 3‑5\\u202fyr, etc.).  \\n4. **Select the lowest recommended rate that meets or exceeds the calculated floor**:  \\n   - For a **short‑term (≤\\u202f3\\u202fyr) loan**, the 5.50\\u202f% rate (DEAL040) is acceptable provided FTP\\u202f≤\\u202f5.35\\u202f%.  \\n   - For a **medium‑term (3‑5\\u202fyr) loan**, the 6.70\\u202f% rate (DEAL041) or 6.85\\u202f% rate (DEAL033) will be compliant if FTP\\u202f≤\\u202f6.50\\u202f%–6.65\\u202f% respectively.  \\n\\nIf the current FTP is higher than the thresholds above, you will need to **offer a higher rate** (e.g., add the required spread to the FTP) to stay within policy limits.\\n\\n---\\n\\n### Action Steps for the Banker\\n\\n1. **Ask the client** for the desired loan tenor (or refer to the deal brief).  \\n2. **Check the latest AED FTP rate** for that tenor.  \\n3. **Calculate the minimum all‑in rate** using the spread table.  \\n4. **Offer the recommended rate** that is **at or above** the calculated floor and respects the deal‑specific pricing limits (max discount, min margin).  \\n\\nThis ensures the offer is both **policy‑compliant** and aligned with FAB’s internal pricing recommendations for CUST001.'}]}"}
