{"ts": "2026-07-03T10:11:52+0530", "level": "INFO", "logger": "agent_framework", "trace_id": "1efd71daea2a9f484e5bbf89159b69ba", "span_id": "f69f6eedeaa57e4b", "parent_span_id": "-", "request_id": "F9F3FC21", "msg": "{'role': 'user', 'parts': [{'type': 'text', 'content': '[Conversation so far]\\nUser: What interest rate should I offer to customer CUST001?\\nAssistant: **Customer:** CUST001 – Al\\u202fNoor Trading LLC  \\n**Internal Rating:** BBB  \\n\\n---\\n\\n### Structured Deal Data (Data Layer)\\n\\n| Deal ID | Recommended\\u202fInterest\\u202fRate | Pricing Limits (Policy) |\\n|---------|---------------------------|--------------------------|\\n| DEAL033 | 6.85\\u202f% | Max Discount\\u202f0.5\\u202f% • Policy\\u202fMax\\u202fDiscount\\u202f0.25\\u202f% • Min\\u202fMargin\\u202f1.75\\u202f% • Min\\u202fExpected\\u202fMargin\\u202f0.75\\u202f% |\\n| DEAL040 | 5.50\\u202f% | Max Discount\\u202f0.25\\u202f% • Policy\\u202fMax\\u202fDiscount\\u202f0.25\\u202f% • Min\\u202fMargin\\u202f0.65\\u202f% • Min\\u202fExpected\\u202fMargin\\u202f0.10\\u202f% |\\n| DEAL041 | 6.70\\u202f% | Max Discount\\u202f0.5\\u202f% • Policy\\u202fMax\\u202fDiscount\\u202f0.25\\u202f% • Min\\u202fMargin\\u202f1.75\\u202f% • Min\\u202fExpected\\u202fMargin\\u202f0.75\\u202f% |\\n\\n*Source:* **query_structured_data – customer_360** (fields listed above).  \\n\\n---\\n\\n### Policy Floor for a BBB‑Rated AED Loan (RAG)\\n\\nFAB Credit Pricing Policy\\u202fv2.4 – **Section\\u202f3.1 (Corporate Term Loans)**  \\n\\n| Facility Tenor | Minimum Pricing Floor (Spread over internal FTP) |\\n|----------------|--------------------------------------------------|\\n| ≤\\u202f1\\u202fYear       | 115\\u202fbps |\\n| 1\\u202f–\\u202f3\\u202fYears    | 145\\u202fbps |\\n| 3\\u202f–\\u202f5\\u202fYears    | 180\\u202fbps |\\n| >\\u202f5\\u202fYears      | 220\\u202fbps |\\n\\n> **All‑in minimum rate** = FTP\\u202frate\\u202f(\\u200bpublished monthly)\\u202f+\\u202fapplicable spread.  \\n> *Example:* FTP\\u202f=\\u202f4.85\\u202f% for a 4‑year loan → floor\\u202f=\\u202f4.85\\u202f%\\u202f+\\u202f1.80\\u202f%\\u202f=\\u202f**6.65\\u202f%**.  \\n\\n*Source:* **query_knowledge_base – FAB_Credit_Pricing_Policy_v2.4**, Clauses\\u202f3.1 &\\u202f3.2.  \\n\\n---\\n\\n### Compliance Check & Recommendation\\n\\n| Deal ID | Recommended Rate | Assumed Tenor* | Minimum Floor (Spread\\u202f+\\u202fFTP) | Verdict |\\n|---------|------------------|----------------|------------------------------|---------|\\n| DEAL040 | 5.50\\u202f% | 1‑3\\u202fYears | FTP\\u202f+\\u202f145\\u202fbps. If FTP\\u202f≤\\u202f5.35\\u202f% → floor\\u202f≤\\u202f5.50\\u202f% → **Compliant**. | Likely compliant for short‑term facilities where FTP is ≤\\u202f5.35\\u202f%. |\\n| DEAL033 | 6.85\\u202f% | 3‑5\\u202fYears | FTP\\u202f+\\u202f180\\u202fbps. If FTP\\u202f≤\\u202f6.65\\u202f% → floor\\u202f≤\\u202f6.85\\u202f% → **Compliant**. | Compliant for medium‑term loans with FTP ≤\\u202f6.65\\u202f%. |\\n| DEAL041 | 6.70\\u202f% | 3‑5\\u202fYears | Same floor as DEAL033. If FTP\\u202f≤\\u202f6.50\\u202f% → floor\\u202f≤\\u202f6.70\\u202f% → **Compliant**. | Generally compliant; check FTP if it is >\\u202f6.50\\u202f%. |\\n\\n\\\\*Tenor is not stored in the deal record; the appropriate floor depends on the loan’s maturity.  \\n\\n**Recommendation**\\n\\n1. **Determine the intended loan tenor** (e.g., 1–3\\u202fyears, 3–5\\u202fyears).  \\n2. **Retrieve the current AED FTP rate** for that tenor (published by FAB Treasury).  \\n3. **Apply the spread from the policy** (145\\u202fbps for 1‑3\\u202fyr, 180\\u202fbps for 3‑5\\u202fyr, etc.).  \\n4. **Select the lowest recommended rate that meets or exceeds the calculated floor**:  \\n   - For a **short‑term (≤\\u202f3\\u202fyr) loan**, the 5.50\\u202f% rate (DEAL040) is acceptable provided FTP\\u202f≤\\u202f5.35\\u202f%.  \\n   - For a **medium‑term (3‑5\\u202fyr) loan**, the 6.70\\u202f% rate (DEAL041) or 6.85\\u202f% rate (DEAL033) will be compliant if FTP\\u202f≤\\u202f6.50\\u202f%–6.65\\u202f% respectively.  \\n\\nIf the current FTP is higher than the thresholds above, you will need to **offer a higher rate** (e.g., add the required spread to the FTP) to stay within policy limits.\\n\\n---\\n\\n### Action Steps for the Banker\\n\\n1. **Ask the client** for the desired loan tenor (or refer to the deal brief).  \\n2. **Check the latest AED FTP rate** for that tenor.  \\n3. **Calculate the minimum all‑in rate** using the spread table.  \\n4. **Offer the recommended rate** that is **at or above** the calculated floor and respects the deal‑specific pricing limits (max discount, min margin).  \\n\\nThis ensures the offer is both **policy‑compliant** and aligned with FAB’s internal pricing recommendations for CUST001.\\n\\n[Current question]\\nWhat interest rate should I offer to customer CUST001?'}]}"}
{"ts": "2026-07-03T10:11:52+0530", "level": "INFO", "logger": "agent_framework", "trace_id": "1efd71daea2a9f484e5bbf89159b69ba", "span_id": "f69f6eedeaa57e4b", "parent_span_id": "-", "request_id": "F9F3FC21", "msg": "{'role': 'assistant', 'parts': [{'type': 'tool_call', 'id': 'fc_38722ed7-b24e-4e49-bb12-cff7d0f4e93c', 'name': 'query_structured_data', 'arguments': '{\"question\":\"Retrieve recommended interest rates, pricing limits, and deal IDs for customer CUST001.\"}'}]}"}
{"ts": "2026-07-03T10:11:52+0530", "level": "INFO", "logger": "agent_framework", "trace_id": "1efd71daea2a9f484e5bbf89159b69ba", "span_id": "f69f6eedeaa57e4b", "parent_span_id": "-", "request_id": "F9F3FC21", "msg": "{'role': 'tool', 'parts': [{'type': 'tool_call_response', 'id': 'fc_38722ed7-b24e-4e49-bb12-cff7d0f4e93c', 'response': 'Here is the complete pricing recommendation data for customer **CUST001 (Al Noor Trading LLC)**, including recommended interest rates, pricing limits, policy floors, and compliance flags for all associated deals.\\n\\n**Source: `pricing_recommendation`**\\n\\n| Deal ID | Deal Date | Customer ID | Customer Name | Segment | Risk Category | Internal Rating | Product ID | Product Name | Product Type | Pricing Method | Max Discount Allowed % | Currency | Tenor | Requested Amount | Funding Cost % | Standard Margin % | Risk Premium % | Relationship Discount % | Recommended Price % | Final Approved Price % | Expected Margin % | Deal Outcome | Sales Channel | Policy Min Margin % | Policy Min Exp Margin % | Policy Max Discount % | Policy RWA Risk Weight % | Price Below Policy Floor | Margin Below Min | Discount Exceeds Policy | Policy Compliant |\\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\\n| DEAL033 | 2025-12-19 | CUST001 | Al Noor Trading LLC | SME | Medium | BBB | PROD003 | Trade Finance LC | Trade Finance | Fixed | 0.5 | AED | 6M | 6,800,000 | 5.40 | 1.25 | 0.45 | 0.25 | 6.85 | 6.80 | 1.05 | Won | API Quote | 1.75 | 0.75 | 0.25 | 75 | 0 | 0 | 0 | 1 |\\n| DEAL040 | 2025-07-19 | CUST001 | Al Noor Trading LLC | SME | Medium | BBB | PROD008 | Corporate Deposit | Deposit | Fixed | 0.25 | AED | 1M | 108,800,000 | 5.05 | 0.25 | 0.45 | 0.25 | 5.50 | 5.45 | -0.50 | Lost | Digital Upload | 0.65 | 0.10 | 0.25 | 75 | 0 | 1 | 0 | 0 |\\n| DEAL041 | 2025-09-04 | CUST001 | Al Noor Trading LLC | SME | Medium | BBB | PROD003 | Trade Finance LC | Trade Finance | Fixed | 0.5 | AED | 3M | 7,600,000 | 5.25 | 1.25 | 0.45 | 0.25 | 6.70 | 6.50 | 0.90 | Won | Branch | 1.75 | 0.75 | 0.25 | 75 | 0 | 0 | 0 | 1 |\\n\\n### Key Observations:\\n* **Recommended vs Approved Prices:** \\n  * **DEAL033:** Recommended 6.85%, Approved 6.80% (Won)\\n  * **DEAL040:** Recommended 5.50%, Approved 5.45% (Lost)\\n  * **DEAL041:** Recommended 6.70%, Approved 6.50% (Won)\\n* **Policy Limits & Compliance:** \\n  * The maximum policy discount allowed across all deals is capped at **0.25%**. The system shows a `policy_max_discount_pct` of 0.25 for all three deals, though `max_discount_allowed_pct` in the deal header shows 0.5 for Trade Finance and 0.25 for Deposits.\\n  * **DEAL040** is flagged as `policy_compliant: 0` and `margin_below_min: 1` because the expected margin (-0.50%) falls below the policy minimum expected margin of 0.10% (and the standard policy min margin of 0.65%). The other two deals are fully compliant.\\n* **Risk & RWA:** All deals carry a **Medium** risk category, **BBB** internal rating, and a **75%** RWA risk weight.'}]}"}
{"ts": "2026-07-03T10:11:52+0530", "level": "INFO", "logger": "agent_framework", "trace_id": "1efd71daea2a9f484e5bbf89159b69ba", "span_id": "f69f6eedeaa57e4b", "parent_span_id": "-", "request_id": "F9F3FC21", "msg": "{'role': 'assistant', 'parts': [{'type': 'tool_call', 'id': 'fc_8725f9ae-6858-4e07-9bce-1d515f61cd11', 'name': 'query_knowledge_base', 'arguments': '{\"question\":\"Current AED FTP rate published by FAB Treasury for 6‑month, 1‑month, and 3‑month tenors\"}'}]}"}
{"ts": "2026-07-03T10:11:52+0530", "level": "INFO", "logger": "agent_framework", "trace_id": "1efd71daea2a9f484e5bbf89159b69ba", "span_id": "f69f6eedeaa57e4b", "parent_span_id": "-", "request_id": "F9F3FC21", "msg": "{'role': 'tool', 'parts': [{'type': 'tool_call_response', 'id': 'fc_8725f9ae-6858-4e07-9bce-1d515f61cd11', 'response': '根据《FAB信用定价政策》（FAB_Credit_Pricing_Policy_v2.4），确切的AED内部资金转移定价（FTP）利率由**FAB Treasury每月设定并发布**。由于基准利率（EIBOR）和流动性溢价（Liquidity Premium）会随时间与市场状况变动，您在起草或确认最终定价时，必须通过内部Treasury定价门户网站获取当月起效的确认利率 `[FAB_Credit_Pricing_Policy_v2.4 · 2.4]`。\\n\\n政策文件并未提供“当月”的实时利率，但提供了一份 **2024年6月** 的**指示性（Illustrative）FTP利率**作为计算参考。各期限对应的FTP逻辑与示例利率如下 `[FAB_Credit_Pricing_Policy_v2.4 · 4.1]`：\\n\\n| 期限 (Tenor) | 适用期限桶 (Tenor Bucket) | 基准利率 | 流动性溢价 (Liquidity Premium) | 期限溢价 | **指示性FTP利息 (2024年6月示例)** |\\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\\n| **1个月** | ≤ 3 months | 3个月AED EIBOR | 15 bps | 0 bps | **5.25%** |\\n| **3个月** | ≤ 3 months | 3个月AED EIBOR | 15 bps | 0 bps | **5.25%** |\\n| **6个月** | 3-12 months | 6个月AED EIBOR | 20 bps | 0 bps | **5.40%** |\\n\\n**⚠️ 重要合规提示：**\\n* 上述 5.25% 和 5.40% 仅为基于2024年6月市场状况的**参考数据（Illustrative）**。根据政策说明：“*Relationship Managers must obtain confirmed FTP rates from Treasury at the time of term sheet issuance*”（《FAB_Credit_Pricing_Policy_v2.4》· 第4.1条），请务必以您在流程系统中拉取的当期确认值为准。\\n* 在计算交易最终定价时，除了作为资金成本的FTP利率外，还必须根据客户评级和产品设计，加上相应的**最低风险利差（Minimum Pricing Floors）**，否则可能触及定价违约并需要提交定价豁免申请。'}]}"}
