| Trade Finance LC | 7,600,000 | 3M | 5.25% | 1.25% | 0.45% | 0.25% | **6.70%** | **6.50%** | **0.90%** | Won | ✅ Yes |\\n\\n---\\n\\n### 📈 Profitability Summary & Tier\\n*Source: `profitability_summary`*\\n\\n| Product Type | Total Won Deals'}]}"}
