large for model `qwen/qwen3.6-27b` in organization `org_01jf7zcn7petgsq9sd18zszhtz` service tier `on_demand` on tokens per minute (TPM): Limit 8000, Requested 8072, please reduce your message size and try again. Need more tokens? Upgrade to Dev Tier today at https://console.groq.com/settings/billing', 'type': 'tokens', 'code': 'rate_limit_exceeded'}}\"))"}
