{"ts": "2026-07-03T10:51:25+0530", "level": "INFO", "logger": "agent_framework", "trace_id": "8a1f31c80e685e9829e0a11aa8e82f04", "span_id": "0bc3960ec1af6485", "parent_span_id": "-", "request_id": "7276662F", "msg": "{'role': 'tool', 'parts': [{'type': 'tool_call_response', 'id': 'fc_f912fd20-6073-4f4c-84d7-de8d61b582d3', 'response': 'Here is the complete pricing recommendation data for customer **CUST001**, retrieved from the `pricing_recommendation` view:\\n\\n| Field | DEAL033 | DEAL040 | DEAL041 |\\n|:---|:---|:---|:---|\\n| **deal_id** | DEAL033 | DEAL040 | DEAL041 |\\n| **deal_date** | 2025-12-19 | 2025-07-19 | 2025-09-04 |\\n| **customer_id** | CUST001 | CUST001 | CUST001 |\\n| **customer_name** | Al Noor Trading LLC | Al Noor Trading LLC | Al Noor Trading LLC |\\n| **customer_segment** | SME | SME | SME |\\n| **risk_category** | Medium | Medium | Medium |\\n| **internal_rating** | BBB | BBB | BBB |\\n| **product_id** | PROD003 | PROD008 | PROD003 |\\n| **product_name** | Trade Finance LC | Corporate Deposit | Trade Finance LC |\\n| **product_type** | Trade Finance | Deposit | Trade Finance |\\n| **pricing_method** | Fixed | Fixed | Fixed |\\n| **max_discount_allowed_pct** | 0.5 | 0.25 | 0.5 |\\n| **currency** | AED | AED | AED |\\n| **tenor** | 6M | 1M | 3M |\\n| **requested_amount** | 6,800,000 | 108,800,000 | 7,600,000 |\\n| **funding_cost_pct** | 5.4 | 5.05 | 5.25 |\\n| **standard_margin_pct** | 1.25 | 0.25 | 1.25 |\\n| **risk_premium_pct** | 0.45 | 0.45 | 0.45 |\\n| **relationship_discount_pct** | 0.25 | 0.25 | 0.25 |\\n| **recommended_price_pct** | 6.85 | 5.5 | 6.7 |\\n| **final_approved_price_pct** | 6.8 | 5.45 | 6.5 |\\n| **expected_margin_pct** | 1.05 | -0.5 | 0.9 |\\n| **deal_outcome** | Won | Lost | Won |\\n| **sales_channel** | API Quote | Digital Upload | Branch |\\n| **policy_min_margin_pct** | 1.75 | 0.65 | 1.75 |\\n| **policy_min_expected_margin_pct** | 0.75 | 0.1 | 0.75 |\\n| **policy_max_discount_pct** | 0.25 | 0.25 | 0.25 |\\n| **policy_rwa_risk_weight_pct** | 75 | 75 | 75 |\\n| **price_below_policy_floor** | 0 | 0 | 0 |\\n| **margin_below_min** | 0 | 1 | 0 |\\n| **discount_exceeds_policy** | 0 | 0 | 0 |\\n| **policy_compliant** | 1 | 0 | 1 |\\n\\n**Source:** `pricing_recommendation`'}]}"}
