{"ts": "2026-07-03T11:01:58+0530", "level": "INFO", "logger": "agent_framework", "trace_id": "aabb982839cbbb4116861950388c33aa", "span_id": "114c1b7407df1c38", "parent_span_id": "-", "request_id": "4387E4F7", "msg": "{'role': 'tool', 'parts': [{'type': 'tool_call_response', 'id': 'fc_8ecdc39f-89c8-463f-8cbe-cec4abebcb5a', 'response': 'Here is the complete pricing recommendation data for customer **CUST002** (Falcon Steel Industries):\\n\\n| Field | Value |\\n|-------|-------|\\n| **deal_id** | DEAL005 |\\n| **deal_date** | 2025-10-24 |\\n| **customer_id** | CUST002 |\\n| **customer_name** | Falcon Steel Industries |\\n| **customer_segment** | Corporate |\\n| **risk_category** | Low |\\n| **internal_rating** | A |\\n| **product_id** | PROD002 |\\n| **product_name** | Term Loan |\\n| **product_type** | Loan |\\n| **pricing_method** | Floating |\\n| **max_discount_allowed_pct** | 0.6 |\\n| **currency** | AED |\\n| **tenor** | 12M |\\n| **requested_amount** | 58,000,000 |\\n| **funding_cost_pct** | 5.55 |\\n| **standard_margin_pct** | 2.1 |\\n| **risk_premium_pct** | 0.1 |\\n| **relationship_discount_pct** | 0.45 |\\n| **recommended_price_pct** | 7.3 |\\n| **final_approved_price_pct** | 7.25 |\\n| **expected_margin_pct** | 1.35 |\\n| **deal_outcome** | Won |\\n| **sales_channel** | API Quote |\\n| **policy_min_margin_pct** | 2.0 |\\n| **policy_min_expected_margin_pct** | 0.75 |\\n| **policy_max_discount_pct** | 0.45 |\\n| **policy_rwa_risk_weight_pct** | 50 |\\n| **price_below_policy_floor** | 0 |\\n| **margin_below_min** | 0 |\\n| **discount_exceeds_policy** | 0 |\\n| **policy_compliant** | 1 |\\n\\n*Source: pricing_recommendation*'}]}"}
