- **Relationship Discount (%):** 0.25\\n- **Recommended Price (%):** 5.5\\n- **Final Approved Price (%):** 5.45\\n- **Expected Margin (%):** -0.5\\n- **Deal Outcome:** Lost\\n- **Sales Channel:** Digital Upload\\n- **Policy Min Margin (%):** 0.65\\n- **Policy Min Expected Margin (%):** 0.1\\n- **Policy Max Discount (%):** 0.25\\n- **Policy RWA Risk Weight (%):** 75\\n- **Price Below Policy Floor:** 0\\n- **Margin Below Min:** 1\\n- **Discount Exceeds Policy:** 0\\n- **Policy Compliant:** 0\\n\\n**Deal 3**\\n- **Deal ID:** DEAL041\\n- **Deal Date:** 2025-09-04\\n- **Customer Segment:** SME\\n- **Risk Category:** Medium\\n- **Internal Rating:** BBB\\n- **Product ID:** PROD003\\n- **Product Name:** Trade Finance LC\\n- **Product Type:** Trade Finance\\n- **Pricing Method:** Fixed\\n- **Max Discount Allowed (%):** 0.5\\n- **Currency:** AED\\n- **Tenor:** 3M\\n- **Requested Amount:** 7,600,000\\n- **Funding Cost (%):** 5.25\\n- **Standard Margin (%):** 1.25\\n- **Risk Premium (%):** 0.45\\n- **Relationship Discount (%):** 0.25\\n- **Recommended Price (%):** 6.7\\n- **Final Approved Price (%):** 6.5\\n- **Expected Margin (%):** 0.9\\n- **Deal Outcome:** Won\\n- **Sales Channel:** Branch\\n- **Policy Min Margin (%):** 1.75\\n- **Policy Min Expected Margin (%):** 0.75\\n- **Policy Max Discount (%):** 0.25\\n- **Policy RWA Risk Weight (%):** 75\\n- **Price Below Policy Floor:** 0\\n- **Margin Below Min:** 0\\n- **Discount Exceeds Policy:** 0\\n- **Policy Compliant:** 1\\n\\n---\\n\\n### Customer: CUST002 (Falcon Steel Industries)\\n**Source: `pricing_recommendation`**\\n\\n**Deal 1**\\n- **Deal ID:** DEAL005\\n- **Deal Date:** 2025-10-24\\n- **Customer Segment:** Corporate\\n- **Risk Category:** Low\\n- **Internal Rating:** A\\n- **Product ID:** PROD002\\n- **Product Name:** Term Loan\\n- **Product Type:** Loan\\n- **Pricing Method:** Floating\\n- **Max Discount Allowed (%):** 0.6\\n- **Currency:** AED\\n- **Tenor:** 12M\\n- **Requested Amount:** 58,000,000\\n- **Funding Cost (%):** 5.55\\n- **Standard Margin (%):** 2.1\\n- **Risk Premium (%):** 0.1\\n- **Relationship Discount (%):** 0.45\\n- **Recommended Price (%):** 7.3\\n- **Final Approved Price (%):** 7.25\\n- **Expected Margin (%):** 1.35\\n- **Deal Outcome:** Won\\n- **Sales Channel:** API Quote\\n- **Policy Min Margin (%):** 2.0\\n- **Policy Min Expected Margin (%):** 0.75\\n- **Policy Max Discount (%):** 0.45\\n- **Policy RWA Risk Weight (%):** 50\\n- **Price Below Policy Floor:** 0\\n- **Margin Below Min:** 0\\n- **Discount Exceeds Policy:** 0\\n- **Policy Compliant:** 1'}]}"}
