{"ts": "2026-07-03T16:20:46+0530", "level": "INFO", "logger": "agent_framework", "trace_id": "55bf7bff7b4170040416a773a7126f60", "span_id": "6efcfca82dc34077", "parent_span_id": "-", "request_id": "B72539D6", "msg": "{'role': 'user', 'parts': [{'type': 'text', 'content': '[Conversation so far]\\nUser: What interest rate should I offer to customer CUST001?\\nAssistant: **Recommended interest rate:** Unable to determine – required data and policy details are currently unavailable.\\n\\n**Evidence**\\n- Structured data query for CUST001 returned no recommendation.\\n- Knowledge base query for pricing floor guidelines returned no policy details.\\n\\n**Action:** Verify the recommended rate in the internal pricing system or contact the pricing team for the latest guidelines.\\nUser: price recommendation for cust001\\nAssistant: ## Recommended Interest Rate\\nRecommended interest rate: **6.70%**\\n\\n## Evidence\\n### Structured Pricing Data (Source: pricing_recommendation)\\n\\n| deal_id | product_name | tenor | recommended_price_pct | final_approved_price_pct | expected_margin_pct | policy_min_margin_pct | policy_min_expected_margin_pct | policy_compliant |\\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\\n| DEAL033 | Trade Finance LC | 6M | 6.85% | 6.80% | 1.05% | 1.75% | 0.75% | 1 |\\n| DEAL040 | Corporate Deposit | 1M | 5.50% | 5.45% | -0.50% | 0.65% | 0.10% | 0 |\\n| DEAL041 | Trade Finance LC | 3M | 6.70% | 6.50% | 0.90% | 1.75% | 0.75% | 1 |\\n\\n- **Deal\\u202f041** offers the lowest recommended price that satisfies all policy constraints (policy_compliant\\u202f=\\u202f1).  \\n- Deals\\u202f033 and\\u202f041 meet the minimum margin and expected margin thresholds; Deal\\u202f040 fails the expected margin test.\\n\\n### Policy Reference (Knowledge Base)\\nThe knowledge‑base query for “Pricing floor guidelines for medium risk SME trade finance product in AED” returned no additional document text. The relevant policy thresholds are already embedded in the structured data fields (e.g., `policy_min_margin_pct`, `policy_min_expected_margin_pct`).\\n\\n## Action Recommendation\\nOffer CUST001 a **6.70%** interest rate on the 3‑month Trade Finance LC (Deal\\u202f041), as it is the lowest price that remains fully policy‑compliant.\\n\\n[Current question]\\nWhat interest rate should I offer to customer CUST001?'}]}"}
