licy_v2.4, Section\\u202f3.1]**.  \\n> (c) “Floors are stated in basis points over the applicable FTP rate… The total all‑in rate must not fall below FTP\\u202f+\\u202fthe stated floor spread.” **[Source: FAB_Credit_Pricing_Policy_v2.4, Section\\u202f3]**.\\n\\n## Action recommendation\\nProvide the loan’s tenor and the applicable FTP rate (or the bank’s internal FTP figure) so the correct floor spread can be applied, and retrieve CUST001’s recommended base rate from the pricing system to calculate the final all‑in interest rate.'}]}"}
