{"ts": "2026-07-03T16:54:05+0530", "level": "INFO", "logger": "agent_framework", "trace_id": "401aadd11e601e0d773b95b8b362294f", "span_id": "c5fa75d5b461798d", "parent_span_id": "-", "request_id": "B8BC3E92", "msg": "{'role': 'tool', 'parts': [{'type': 'tool_call_response', 'id': 'fc_f710d287-6dbc-4e77-9644-f4ee6f0307a4', 'response': 'Based on the retrieved FAB Credit Pricing Policy, specific pricing floors for **Trade Finance Letters of Credit (LC)** and **Corporate Deposit** products are not included in the available documents. \\n\\nThe policy does, however, establish the following minimum pricing floors (expressed as a basis point spread over the Funds Transfer Pricing rate) for a **BB-rated** corporate customer in AED across other standard lending products:\\n- **Corporate Term Loans**: 165 bps (tenor ≤ 1 year), 210 bps (1–3 years), 260 bps (3–5 years), and 320 bps (> 5 years) [Source: FAB_Credit_Pricing_Policy_v2.4, Section 3.1].\\n- **Revolving Credit Facilities (RCF)**: 160 bps drawn margin floor [Source: FAB_Credit_Pricing_Policy_v2.4, Section 3.2].\\n\\n⚠ **Caveat**: Trade finance instruments and deposit products typically operate under distinct fee schedules (e.g., LC issuance/confirmation fees or deposit rate ceilings) that are often housed in separate product manuals or treasury guidelines rather than the core credit pricing policy. Please verify with the Trade Finance Product Owner or'}]}"}
{"ts": "2026-07-03T16:54:08+0530", "level": "INFO", "logger": "agent_framework", "trace_id": "401aadd11e601e0d773b95b8b362294f", "span_id": "c5fa75d5b461798d", "parent_span_id": "-", "request_id": "B8BC3E92", "msg": "{'role': 'assistant', 'parts': [{'type': 'text', 'content': '<llm_reasoning>{\"phase\":\"synthesis\",\"sources_used\":[\"query_structured_data\",\"query_knowledge_base\"],\"key_findings\":[\"CUST001 recommended rates\",\"policy floor unavailable\",\"partial compliance assessment\"],\"answer_rationale\":\"Combined product‑specific recommended rates from pricing data with available policy floor information; flagged missing floors for LC and Deposit products\"}<\\\\/llm_reasoning>\\n\\n**Recommended interest rates for CUST001**\\n\\n| Product | Tenor | Recommended Rate | Compliance Note |\\n|---|---|---|---|\\n| Trade Finance LC | 6\\u202fmonths | 6.85% | Policy floor not defined for LC (cannot verify) |\\n| Trade Finance LC | 3\\u202fmonths | 6.70% | Policy floor not defined for LC (cannot verify) |\\n| Corporate Deposit | 1\\u202fmonth | 5.50% | Policy floor not defined for Deposit (cannot verify) |\\n\\n**Evidence**\\n\\n### Structured pricing data\\n| Deal ID | Product Name | Tenor | Recommended Price | Approved Price | Expected Margin | Policy Compliant |\\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|\\n| DEAL033 | Trade Finance LC | 6M | 6.85% | 6.80% | 1.05% | Yes |\\n| DEAL040 | Corporate Deposit | 1M | 5.50% | 5.45% | -0.50% | No |\\n| DEAL041 | Trade Finance LC | 3M | 6.70% | 6.50% | 0.90% | Yes |\\n\\n*Source: pricing_recommendation*\\n\\n### Policy floor information\\n- FAB Credit Pricing Policy v2.4, Section\\u202f3.1: Corporate Term Loans floor\\u202f165\\u202fbps (≤\\u202f1\\u202fyr) … (no LC floor listed).  \\n- FAB Credit Pricing Policy v2.4, Section\\u202f3.2: Revolving Credit Facilities drawn margin floor\\u202f160\\u202fbps (no Deposit floor listed).  \\n\\n⚠ The retrieved policy does not contain pricing floors for **Trade Finance Letter of Credit** or **Corporate Deposit** products; therefore compliance cannot be fully validated for these items.\\n\\n**Action recommendation**  \\nOffer the Trade Finance LC rates (6.85% for 6\\u202fM, 6.70% for 3\\u202fM) as they are approved and margin‑positive; for the Corporate Deposit rate, obtain the specific deposit‑rate ceiling from the Treasury product manual before finalizing.'}]}"}
