{"ts": "2026-07-03T17:52:49+0530", "level": "INFO", "logger": "agent_framework", "trace_id": "27a85d73fd4df414d0eebf938d3674aa", "span_id": "6f84e9b58c0a7c41", "parent_span_id": "-", "request_id": "73953046", "msg": "{'role': 'assistant', 'parts': [{'type': 'tool_call', 'id': 'fc_0890ded2-d960-441c-ac32-5924acc94321', 'name': 'query_knowledge_base', 'arguments': '{\"question\":\"FAB pricing recommendation policy for corporate loans, including base rate, margin guidelines, rating considerations, and product type.\"}'}]}"}
{"ts": "2026-07-03T17:52:49+0530", "level": "INFO", "logger": "agent_framework", "trace_id": "27a85d73fd4df414d0eebf938d3674aa", "span_id": "6f84e9b58c0a7c41", "parent_span_id": "-", "request_id": "73953046", "msg": "{'role': 'tool', 'parts': [{'type': 'tool_call_response', 'id': 'fc_0890ded2-d960-441c-ac32-5924acc94321', 'response': \"**Answer:**  \\nFAB’s pricing recommendation policy requires that every corporate loan be built on the Treasury‑published Funds Transfer Price (FTP) as the base rate, to which a risk‑based margin (credit spread) is added. The margin must meet minimum spreads that depend on the client’s internal rating, the loan tenor, and the product type (e.g., corporate term loan vs. revolving credit facility). Additional fees (arrangement, commitment, agency) are applied according to the product‑specific tables, and a relationship‑value adjustment can reduce the required margin by up to\\u202f25\\u202fbps for high‑cross‑sell clients.\\n\\n**Supporting passages**\\n\\n- *Base rate (FTP) definition*: “FTP (Funds Transfer Price)…the internal cost of funds allocated to each facility based on tenor, currency, and product type, as determined by FAB's Treasury function on a monthly basis.”\\u202f[Source: FAB_Credit_Pricing_Policy_v2.4, Section\\u202f1.1]\\n\\n- *Margin (credit spread) floors for corporate term loans*:  \\n\\n  | Client Rating | Tenor\\u202f≤\\u202f1\\u202fyr | 1‑3\\u202fyr | 3‑5\\u202fyr |\\u202f>\\u202f5\\u202fyr |  \\n  |---------------|-------------|-------|-------|-------|  \\n  | BBB | 115\\u202fbps | 145\\u202fbps | **180\\u202fbps** | 220\\u202fbps |  \\n\\n  (Example in text: “A BBB‑rated client requesting a 4‑year AED term loan… Minimum floor spread\\u202f=\\u202f180\\u202fbps.”)\\u202f[Source: FAB_Credit_Pricing_Policy_v2.4, Section\\u202f3.1]\\n\\n- *Margin (drawn‑margin) floors for revolving credit facilities*:  \\n\\n  | Client Rating | Drawn Margin Floor | Commitment Fee Floor | Facility Fee Floor | Tenure\\u202f≤\\u202f3\\u202fyr | Tenure\\u202f>\\u202f3\\u202fyr (add‑on) |  \\n  |---------------|-------------------|----------------------|-------------------|--------------|----------------------|  \\n  | BBB | 110\\u202fbps | 30\\u202fbps | 15\\u202fbps | Applies | Add\\u202f25\\u202fbps |  \\n\\n \\u202f[Source: FAB_Credit_Pricing_Policy_v2.4, Section\\u202f3.2]\\n\\n- *Product‑type‑specific fees*: “Arrangement Fee\\u202f=\\u202f30\\u202fbps of facility amount (MLA syndicated loans) … Agency Fee\\u202f=\\u202fUSD\\u202f25,000 / AED\\u202f90,000 per annum when FAB acts as Facility Agent.”\\u202f[Source: FAB_Credit_Pricing_Policy_v2.4, Section\\u202f3.3]\\n\\n- *Relationship‑value adjustment*: “May reduce the required margin by up to\\u202f25\\u202fbps … subject to cross‑sell revenues\\u202f>\\u202fAED\\u202f500,000\\u202fp.a.”\\u202f[Source: FAB_Credit_Pricing_Policy_v2.4, Section\\u202f2.4]\\n\\n**Caveats / Conditions**\\n\\n- All spreads are **over the FTP rate**; the all‑in rate = FTP\\u202f+\\u202fspread\\u202f+\\u202fany applicable fees.  \\n- Floors are absolute minima; any pricing below a floor requires a formal Pricing Exception (Section\\u202f6 of the policy).  \\n- The policy version referenced is effective\\u202f1\\u202fJune\\u202f2024 (FAB‑POL‑PRICE‑2024‑v2.4) and may be superseded by later revisions.  \\n- Relationship‑value reductions are limited to 25\\u202fbps and need approval per Section\\u202f5.  \\n\\n---\"}]}"}
{"ts": "2026-07-03T17:52:51+0530", "level": "INFO", "logger": "agent_framework", "trace_id": "27a85d73fd4df414d0eebf938d3674aa", "span_id": "6f84e9b58c0a7c41", "parent_span_id": "-", "request_id": "73953046", "msg": "{'role': 'assistant', 'parts': [{'type': 'text', 'content': '<llm_reasoning>{\"phase\":\"intent_routing\",\"intent\":\"hybrid\",\"data_signals\":[\"pricing recommendation\",\"CUST002\"],\"rag_signals\":[\"pricing recommendation policy\",\"corporate loans\"],\"rationale\":\"User asks for a price for a specific customer, which requires both the customer’s deal data and the bank’s pricing policy\",\"confidence\":0.98}</llm_reasoning>\\n\\n<llm_reasoning>{\"phase\":\"synthesis\",\"sources_used\":[\"query_structured_data\",\"query_knowledge_base\"],\"key_findings\":[\"customer data unavailable\",\"policy margin floors\"],\"answer_rationale\":\"Because the structured data for CUST002 could not be retrieved, the response can only convey the applicable policy and note the data gap\",\"steps\":[\"identified hybrid intent\",\"called query_structured_data – returned DATA_UNAVAILABLE\",\"called query_knowledge_base – returned pricing policy details\",\"compared available policy with missing customer data\",\"produced verdict noting data unavailability\"]}</llm_reasoning>\\n\\n**Unable to provide a pricing recommendation for CUST002 due to missing customer data.**  \\n\\n## Supporting Policy Details\\n| Client Rating | Tenor ≤\\u202f1\\u202fyr | 1‑3\\u202fyr | 3‑5\\u202fyr | >\\u202f5\\u202fyr |\\n|---------------|-------------|-------|-------|-------|\\n| BBB | 115\\u202fbps | 145\\u202fbps | **180\\u202fbps** | 220\\u202fbps |\\n\\n*Source: query_knowledge_base – *FAB_Credit_Pricing_Policy_v2.4*, Section\\u202f3.1 (margin floors for corporate term loans).  \\n\\n- **Base rate**: FTP (Funds Transfer Price) set by Treasury (Section\\u202f1.1).  \\n- **Margin**: Must be equal to or exceed the floor above, added to FTP.  \\n- **Product‑type fees**: Arrangement fee\\u202f=\\u202f30\\u202fbps of facility amount; Agency fee\\u202f=\\u202fUSD\\u202f25,000 / AED\\u202f90,000 per annum (Section\\u202f3.3).  \\n- **Relationship‑value adjustment**: Up to\\u202f‑25\\u202fbps possible for high‑cross‑sell clients (Section\\u202f2.4).\\n\\n## Action Recommendation\\nPlease verify that CUST002’s deal data (base rate, rating, tenor, product type) is available in the Data Layer, then request the pricing recommendation again.'}]}"}
