{"ts": "2026-07-05T15:45:27+0530", "level": "INFO", "logger": "agent_framework", "trace_id": "0f1bbd76d5bea9f90cdf3d19ec576776", "span_id": "f6ec55b38df2cefc", "parent_span_id": "-", "request_id": "8B157DCB", "msg": "{'role': 'tool', 'parts': [{'type': 'tool_call_response', 'id': 'fc_ec695267-c58a-4ba9-9062-2f5e586feae5', 'response': 'Here are the pricing recommendation breakdowns for customer **CUST001 (Al Noor Trading LLC)**:\\n\\n| Deal ID | Product Type | Tenor | Treasury/Funding Cost (%) | Target/Expected Margin (%) | Risk Premium (%) | Ops Cost (%) | Relationship Discount (%) | Final Recommended Price (%) | Approved Price (%) |\\n|:---|:---|:---|:---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|\\n| DEAL033 | Trade Finance | 6M | 5.40 | 1.80 | 0.45 | 1.47 | -0.25 | 8.87 | 6.80 |\\n| DEAL040 | Deposit | 1M | 5.05 | 0.25 | 0.45 | 0.30 | -0.25 | 5.80 | 5.45 |\\n| DEAL041 | Trade Finance | 3M | 5.25 | 1.80 | 0.45 | 1.47 | -0.25 | 8.72 | 6.50 |\\n\\n**Key Observations:**\\n- All three deals apply a consistent risk premium of **0.45%** and relationship discount of **-0.25%**.\\n- Trade Finance products (DEAL033, DEAL041) carry a higher target margin (1.80%) and operational cost (~1.47%) compared to the Deposit product (DEAL040).\\n- Approved prices are consistently lower than the system-recommended prices across all deals.'}]}"}
{"ts": "2026-07-05T15:45:29+0530", "level": "INFO", "logger": "agent_framework", "trace_id": "0f1bbd76d5bea9f90cdf3d19ec576776", "span_id": "f6ec55b38df2cefc", "parent_span_id": "-", "request_id": "8B157DCB", "msg": "{'role': 'assistant', 'parts': [{'type': 'tool_call', 'id': 'fc_b1dc486c-e33e-472f-9afb-403163730852', 'name': 'query_knowledge_base', 'arguments': '{\"question\":\"What is the FAB pricing methodology for trade finance loan pricing, including components such as funding cost, target margin, risk premium, operational cost, and relationship discount?\"}'}]}"}
